    <description>The one report that tests whether the ranking is real. If the top bands are mostly sent and called while the bottom bands are mostly snoozed, ignored or wrong person, the score is carrying information. If every band looks the same, it is not.</description>
    <filter>
        <criteriaItems>
            <column>Lead.Omnishift_Rank__c</column>
            <isUnlocked>true</isUnlocked>
            <operator>greaterThan</operator>
